Edge cases covered:

- `P3DT4H5M` — days, hours, minutes
- `PT1H30M` — time-only
- `P1D` — date-only
- `PT1S` — seconds-only
- `P1W`, `P2W` — weeks
- `PT0S` — zero duration
- `PT0.5S`, `PT1.25S` — fractional seconds
- `-P1D`, `+PT1H` — optional sign
- lowercase input
- invalid empty string
- missing `P`
- bare `P`
- `T` with no time component
- years/months rejected as ambiguous
- `PT1M` correctly treated as minutes
- weeks combined with other components rejected

