## Alternative approach: dedicated worker thread with `wait`/`notify`

Instead of scheduling and cancelling tasks on an executor, give each debouncer a dedicated worker thread. `call` only updates the latest value and timestamp, then notifies the worker. The worker waits until the quiet period has elapsed, and then runs the action once.

